  "description": "Ha-Na runs into a suspicious saleswoman on the street who hands her a bath gel sample, saying it'll give her what she truly needs. Intrigued by this cryptic message, Ha-Na goes home and tries out the bath gel, only to be seized by tentacles that suddenly pop out of the water! Thankfully, her childhood friend, Won-Hoo, walks in and saves her, but Hana wants to die of embarrassment. Even so, she can't help accepting more weird \"self-care\" products from the mysterious saleswoman. Will her questionable samples be the key to helping Hana relax and get closer to Won-Hoo?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
